    "html": "<h2 id=\"why-now\"><a href=\"#why-now\">Why Now</a></h2>\n<p>I&#x27;ve always wanted a corner of my own — free from algorithms, free from judgments.\nHere you&#x27;ll find fragments of daily life, thoughts from work, and stray ideas that came out of nowhere.</p>\n<h2 id=\"what-this-site-will-hold\"><a href=\"#what-this-site-will-hold\">What This Site Will Hold</a></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Journal</strong>: book notes, films, travels, and bits that don&#x27;t fit a category.</li>\n<li><strong>Tech Blog</strong>: lessons from the trenches, things learned, experiments done.</li>\n<li><strong>Projects</strong>: work I&#x27;m happy to show, and a reminder of what I&#x27;ve tried.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"to-close\"><a href=\"#to-close\">To Close</a></h2>\n<p>Writing is a conversation with yourself. The speed comes from machines; the warmth comes from people.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Slow and steady wins the race.</p>\n</blockquote>",
